  "description": "This model provides a ~104M-parameter rectified-flow DiT and SD VAE exported to ONNX format, enabling image generation directly in browsers using WebGPU. It accepts text prompts as input and outputs 256×256 pixel images, supporting Euler CFG sampling with defaults of 50 steps and CFG 3.0. The source states that the model uses fp32 precision throughout to avoid silent NaN errors common in fp16 implementations on various GPU drivers.",
